<section class="panel sound-settings" aria-labelledby="sound-title"><h2 class="strip-title" id="sound-title">Sounds of the Realm</h2><p>Short action sounds, no background music. Playback begins after a tap. Your mute and volume choices are remembered.</p><form method="post" action="/game/settings/sound" data-sound-settings><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><label for="sound-enabled">Game sound</label><select id="sound-enabled" name="enabled"><option value="0"<% if(!sound.enabled) { %> selected<% } %>>Muted</option><option value="1"<% if(sound.enabled) { %> selected<% } %>>Enabled</option></select><label for="sound-volume">Volume <output data-sound-volume><%= sound.volume %>%</output></label><input id="sound-volume" name="volume" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="<%= sound.volume %>"><button class="button button-gold" type="submit" data-preference-save>Save Sound Settings</button><button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-sound-preview>Preview</button><p class="field-hint" data-sound-status role="status">Your preference is saved with your character. Your device may ask for a tap to start playback.</p></form></section>
<section class="panel"><h2 class="strip-title">Your Account</h2><p>Signed in as <strong><%= accountName %></strong>. Your character and progress remain in this realm when you sign out.</p><div class="settings-links"><a class="button button-outline" href="/game/profile#account">Calling</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/game/profile?tab=skills#skills">Skills</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/rules">Realm Rules &amp; Help</a></div><form method="post" action="/logout" class="settings-logout"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="button button-signout" type="submit"><span aria-hidden="true">↪</span> Sign Out</button></form></section>
<section class="panel"><h2 class="strip-title">Community &amp; Safety</h2><p class="compact-help">Comments and broadcasts are public plain text. Never share passwords or personal details. Use Report on a message to request moderator review. You can remove your own posts and hide comments from your profile. Reports do not automatically hide posts or award rewards.</p><p class="compact-help">Temporary rivals never post or invite players. Social posting limits are rolling 24-hour windows. The Vault protects your savings. Tap Health for recovery options. Private messaging is not available.</p></section>

